# DVC Local Configuration Template (.dvc/config.local.example)
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# To configure a remote storage target for shared team synchronization:
#
# 1. Local Filesystem Remote (Default for development & testing - no credentials needed):
#      dvc remote add -d local_storage /tmp/dvc_remote_storage
#
# 2. AWS S3 Remote:
#      dvc remote add -d s3_remote s3://my-mlops-bucket/dvc-store
#      # In CI/CD or local env, set: AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID, AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
#
# 3. Google Cloud Storage (GCS) Remote:
#      dvc remote add -d gcs_remote gs://my-mlops-bucket/dvc-store
#      # In CI/CD or local env, set: GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS
#
# Standard DVC Operations:
#   - Track dataset changes:     dvc add data/reference
#   - Push data to remote:       dvc push
#   - Fetch data from remote:    dvc pull
#   - Reproduce pipeline:        dvc repro
#
# SECURITY: Never commit credentials or .dvc/config.local into Git.
